(6890186, 1038730, 153814, '<td valign="top">This is great and really fits the challenge.<br/>Those 2 pumpkins out of place bother me, call it O.C.D.<br/>It may have brought out an emotion I didn''t want but it did<br/>so it worked.<br/>That makes this image GREAT.<br/>One of my top picks.</td>', 'This is great and really fits the challenge.Those 2 pumpkins out of place bother me, call it O.C.D.It may have brought out an emotion I didn''t want but it didso it worked.That makes this image GREAT.One of my top picks.', '2012-10-24 15:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890209, 1038231, 124815, '<td valign="top">Astonishing image. Great processing. It is a true one-of-a-kind  shot belonging to an album of our times.</td>', 'Astonishing image. Great processing. It is a true one-of-a-kind  shot belonging to an album of our times.', '2012-10-24 16:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890211, 1038769, 124815, '<td valign="top">The image of innocence, with no sense of ridicule ! The posture, the "outfit" is so touching.</td>', 'The image of innocence, with no sense of ridicule ! The posture, the "outfit" is so touching.', '2012-10-24 16:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
