(6890215, 1038677, 124815, '<td valign="top">Surely fits the challenge in a very direct, literal way. But is it a picture you want to look at independently of this challenge frame?</td>', 'Surely fits the challenge in a very direct, literal way. But is it a picture you want to look at independently of this challenge frame?', '2012-10-24 16:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
