(6890254, 1038707, 147314, '<td valign="top">Is the flower distracting? Or is it the (out of focus) leaves and rocks? Somehow the whole image is making a distracting impression, guess that''s good. - 6</td>', 'Is the flower distracting? Or is it the (out of focus) leaves and rocks? Somehow the whole image is making a distracting impression, guess that''s good. - 6', '2012-10-24 17:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890261, 1038756, 147314, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I''m looking at. And what are the distracting elements? I guess the blue-ish effects on the columns, the bright light in the background and the yellow/gold coloured something on the foreground. But I do like the picture - 7</td>', 'Not sure what I''m looking at. And what are the distracting elements? I guess the blue-ish effects on the columns, the bright light in the background and the yellow/gold coloured something on the foreground. But I do like the picture - 7', '2012-10-24 17:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890264, 1038229, 147314, '<td valign="top">Is blur distracting? The imperfection surely is. Nice colours too.</td>', 'Is blur distracting? The imperfection surely is. Nice colours too.', '2012-10-24 17:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890269, 1038730, 147314, '<td valign="top">What''s distracting: the railway track, the not-in-focus pumpkins, the lonely pumpkin next to the track, the people on the top-left? Well done.</td>', 'What''s distracting: the railway track, the not-in-focus pumpkins, the lonely pumpkin next to the track, the people on the top-left? Well done.', '2012-10-24 17:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890273, 1038734, 147314, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. The ruined flower surely is distracting, I''m not sure about the eyes. But well done.</td>', 'Lovely image. The ruined flower surely is distracting, I''m not sure about the eyes. But well done.', '2012-10-24 17:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890274, 1038786, 113419, '<td valign="top">very nice!  looks like a painting</td>', 'very nice!  looks like a painting', '2012-10-24 17:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890277, 1038820, 147314, '<td valign="top">Great picture, beautiful scenery. I can see the scripts on the rocks is one distracting element, not sure about a second one (unless you count these scripts as more than one element).</td>', 'Great picture, beautiful scenery. I can see the scripts on the rocks is one distracting element, not sure about a second one (unless you count these scripts as more than one element).', '2012-10-24 17:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890278, 1038703, 113419, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see a distracint element - he looks more framed to me than anything else, the fore ground leads you to him - then the rope shadow and pipes frame his face - and the dof blurs out the background - I think its an amazing photo</td>', 'I don''t really see a distracint element - he looks more framed to me than anything else, the fore ground leads you to him - then the rope shadow and pipes frame his face - and the dof blurs out the background - I think its an amazing photo', '2012-10-24 17:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6890280, 1038650, 113419, '<td valign="top">to me the ear tags aren''t distracting (I''ve worked wtih cattle alot, to me ear tags are supposed to be there)  what I find more distracting is the post seemingly coming out of the head - maybe that is your distrating element - if so, your title is gonna loose you some point</td>', 'to me the ear tags aren''t distracting (I''ve worked wtih cattle alot, to me ear tags are supposed to be there)  what I find more distracting is the post seemingly coming out of the head - maybe that is your distrating element - if so, your title is gonna loose you some point', '2012-10-24 17:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
