(6890290, 1038716, 113419, '<td valign="top">nice work!  good distracint elements!  I did a photo of my nephew once - beautiful christmas time photo of him looking out the window watching for Santa....he was around 3, leaning on his hand, I LOVED IT but all his mom could see was the dirt under his fingernail  LOL</td>', 'nice work!  good distracint elements!  I did a photo of my nephew once - beautiful christmas time photo of him looking out the window watching for Santa....he was around 3, leaning on his hand, I LOVED IT but all his mom could see was the dirt under his fingernail  LOL', '2012-10-24 17:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
