(6890306, 1038072, 147314, '<td valign="top">I can see the background text is one distracting element. The other one: the wires? Or is it the underexposure of the left side of the image?</td>', 'I can see the background text is one distracting element. The other one: the wires? Or is it the underexposure of the left side of the image?', '2012-10-24 18:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
