(6898088, 1038555, 39429, '<td valign="top">As I was going through the shots from 1st place on through, I was expecting to see a nice shot, but not wow.  This is a wow.  It has depth, interest and mood.  While the subject matter does matter, the forms and layers say more to me.  A stopper.</td>', 'As I was going through the shots from 1st place on through, I was expecting to see a nice shot, but not wow.  This is a wow.  It has depth, interest and mood.  While the subject matter does matter, the forms and layers say more to me.  A stopper.', '2012-11-04 17:48:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6898095, 1038555, 41746, '<td valign="top">Yes, a great image. A stopper. Fave.</td>', 'Yes, a great image. A stopper. Fave.', '2012-11-04 18:14:01.000000', NULL, 0),
